{
  "pid": "self-medium-05",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "合格蒸汽产量与净收益累计（闭区间判定 + 数据故障冻结）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，按扫描周期累计锅炉的合格蒸汽产量、燃料消耗与净收益。\n控制要求：\n1. 合格判据：steamTemp 在 [447.0, 453.0] 且 steamPressure 在 [3750.0, 3850.0]（**闭区间**，端点合格；温度高于 453、压力低于 3750 或高于 3850 都判不合格）；\n2. 本周期合格且 enable=TRUE 且无数据故障时，qualifiedTon += steamFlow * dt / 1000.0（流量按 kg/s、周期按 s 计，kg/s × s ÷ 1000 = t）；无论是否合格，只要 enable 且无故障，fuelTon += fuelFlow * dt / 1000.0；\n3. 数据故障判据：dt <= 0.0 或 dt > 10.0（含恰好 10.0 合法、10.0 以上非法）或 steamFlow 不在 [0,90] 或 fuelFlow 不在 [0,6]（负流量同样判故障）；故障拍不累计；无复位沿时保持累计值，有复位沿时按第 4 条清零；\n4. resetBtn 上升沿：两个累计量清零，且**当拍不再累计**。复位是边沿命令、不是保持命令：按住的时长不影响判定，每拍只认有没有新的上升沿。**复位优先于故障冻结**：同一拍同时出现复位上升沿与数据故障时，先执行清零，清零结果生效（故障位仍如实报出，但累计量不得停留在旧值）；\n5. revenue = qualifiedTon * 280.0，cost = fuelTon * 1500.0，netProfit = revenue - cost，三者每拍都要更新（即使不累计）。单价单位：蒸汽 280 元/t，燃料 1500 元/t，配 kg 换算后金额单位为元；\n6. qualifiedTon、fuelTon、revenue、cost 必须非负；netProfit **允许为负**（烧燃料不产汽时会亏损）。复位上升沿优先于禁用和故障。无复位沿且 enable=FALSE 时保持累计量，qualified 和 dataFault 仍按当拍输入更新。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "enable",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "计量使能",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "resetBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "清零按钮（上升沿有效）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "dt",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "本周期时长（s），合法 0 < dt <= 10",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "steamFlow",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "蒸汽流量（kg/s），合法 0..90",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "fuelFlow",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "燃料流量（kg/s），合法 0..6",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "steamTemp",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "蒸汽温度（℃）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "steamPressure",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "蒸汽压力（kPa）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "qualified",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "本周期蒸汽是否合格",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "dataFault",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "数据故障（参数越界）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "qualifiedTon",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "累计合格蒸汽产量（t）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "fuelTon",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "累计燃料消耗（t）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "revenue",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "累计收入（元）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "cost",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "累计成本（元）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "netProfit",
      "data_type": "LREAL",
      "description": "累计净收益（元）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "合格判据：温度 447..453 ℃ 且 压力 3750..3850 kPa（闭区间）。",
      "ltl": "G(qualified <-> (steamTemp >= 447.0 & steamTemp <= 453.0 & steamPressure >= 3750.0 & steamPressure <= 3850.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "产量、燃料、收入、成本四项累计量永远非负（净收益不在此列，允许亏损）。",
      "ltl": "G((qualifiedTon >= 0.0) & (fuelTon >= 0.0) & (revenue >= 0.0) & (cost >= 0.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "复位上升沿当拍把两个累计量清零。",
      "ltl": "G(rising(resetBtn) -> (qualifiedTon = 0.0 & fuelTon = 0.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "数据故障判据：dt 不在 (0,10] 或流量越界。",
      "ltl": "G(dataFault <-> (dt <= 0.0 | dt > 10.0 | steamFlow < 0.0 | steamFlow > 90.0 | fuelFlow < 0.0 | fuelFlow > 6.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "没有复位上升沿时，若数据故障或未使能，累计燃料在本拍保持不变；复位沿按 S3 优先清零。",
      "ltl": "G((!rising(resetBtn) & (!enable | dataFault)) -> fuelTon = prev(fuelTon))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S6",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "数据故障且未复位时，累计产量在本拍保持不变。",
      "ltl": "G((dataFault & !rising(resetBtn)) -> qualifiedTon = prev(qualifiedTon))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S7",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "金额三式恒成立：收入=产量×280、成本=燃料×1500、净收益=收入-成本。",
      "ltl": "G((revenue = qualifiedTon * 280.0) & (cost = fuelTon * 1500.0) & (netProfit = revenue - cost))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S9",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "复位上升沿优先于故障冻结：复位与数据故障同拍时，累计量仍必须清零。",
      "ltl": "G((rising(resetBtn) & dataFault) -> (qualifiedTon = 0.0 & fuelTon = 0.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S10",
      "kind": "data",
      "text": "累计量按 flow*dt/1000 递推，收入=产量*280，成本=燃料*1500。",
      "ltl": "",
      "verified_by": "simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S11",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "没有复位沿且使能、数据有效时，本拍燃料累计量必须按燃料流量和实际步长增加。",
      "ltl": "G((!rising(resetBtn) AND enable AND !dataFault) -> fuelTon = prev(fuelTon) + fuelFlow * dt / 1000.0)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S12",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "合格、使能且数据有效的非复位拍按蒸汽流量和步长增加合格吨数；其余非复位拍保持上拍的合格吨数。",
      "ltl": "G(!rising(resetBtn) -> (((enable AND !dataFault AND qualified) -> qualifiedTon = prev(qualifiedTon) + steamFlow * dt / 1000.0) AND ((!enable OR dataFault OR !qualified) -> qualifiedTon = prev(qualifiedTon))))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    }
  ],
